diff --git a/db/extension_db.yml b/db/extension_db.yml
index b7e1adbab..4ebd302fc 100644
--- a/db/extension_db.yml
+++ b/db/extension_db.yml
@@ -138,6 +138,39 @@ Body:
       a new period starts.
     Enabled: false
 
+  - Id: skill_damage_level
+    Name: Skill damage does not grow with base level or job level
+    Description: |
+      Some skills read the caster's base level or job level in their damage:
+      Dragon Breath, Self Destruction, Gates of Hell, Renovatio, Crescent
+      Elbow's counter, Gravity Control, Cross Slash, the Sorcerer's
+      elementals, Quick Draw Shot's hit count, the statuses of Enchant Blade,
+      Exceed Break, Zangetsu, Windmill Rush and Moonlight Serenade, and of
+      the older skills Esma, Flying Kick, the Star Gladiator's Wrath, Demon
+      Bane, Turn Undead (kill chance and fail damage), Heal, Highness Heal
+      and Coluceo Heal. With this on, those formulas read a player's
+      base level only up to base_level, and (Quick Draw Shot, Exceed Break
+      and the two songs) read job_level in place of the player's job level,
+      so a server that lets some jobs level past the classic cap does not
+      make these skills grow with it. With base_level at the classic cap a
+      character at or below it is unchanged. Monsters' levels are never
+      changed.
+      Off is stock rAthena: the formulas read the real levels.
+    Enabled: false
+    Values:
+      - Key: base_level
+        Type: Int
+        Default: 99
+        Min: 1
+        Max: 275
+        Description: Highest base level these damage formulas see.
+      - Key: job_level
+        Type: Int
+        Default: 70
+        Min: 1
+        Max: 275
+        Description: The job level these damage formulas see for every player.
+
 Footer:
   Imports:
     - Path: db/import/extension_db.yml
