 |---|---|
 | `pc_drop_item_event` | Fires an `OnPCDropItemEvent` script event for each item a monster drops for a player |
+| `skill_damage_level` | Skill output reads a player's base level only up to `base_level` (99), and `job_level` (70) in place of the job level. Base level: Dragon Breath, Self Destruction, Gates of Hell, Renovatio, Crescent Elbow's counter, Gravity Control, Cross Slash, the Elemental Master's elementals, Enchant Blade, Exceed Break, Zangetsu, Esma, Flying Kick, the Star Gladiator's Wrath, Demon Bane, Turn Undead (kill chance and fail damage), Heal, Highness Heal, Coluceo Heal. Job level: Quick Draw Shot's hits, Exceed Break, Windmill Rush, Moonlight Serenade. The same formulas ask a mod's Lua `level` / `job_level` hook (`src/map/skill_lua.hpp`) |
 | `map_mob_count_rate` | Enables `setmapmobcountrate`, which scales the monster count of every spawn line on one map |
